<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov freight traffic down 0.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov freight traffic down 0.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's total freight traffic in January-November was 2.45 billion tonnes, down 0.1 percent from the same period last year, the Xinhua news agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handled at principal seaports rose a year-on-year 8.5 percent to 739 million tonnes in the period, the agency said, quoting figures from the State Statistical Bureau.</p>
<p>The total number of passengers carried by all means of transportation in the 11 months was 4.46 billion, up 0.2 percent from the year-ago period, it said without giving further details.</p>
</text>
